-- usage and help
Usage: todo [options] <command> ...
Usage: remote [options] <command> ...
Usage: todo [options] <command> ...

Keep a to-do list.

Commands:
  add                Add a task.
  list               List the tasks.
  stats              Count the tasks.
  remote             Manage the remotes.
  help <command>     show the help of a command

Options:
  -f, --file <file>  the list (default: todo.txt)
  -q, --quiet        say less
  -h, --help         show this help and exit
      --version      show the version and exit
